    {
      "id": 100156,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-25T02:04:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It wouldn't be &gt;G, but their lawyers who would say one way or the other.</p><p>While it is likely safe, Lawyers might not agree, and smart businesses listen to their lawyers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you like the theme of a villain from the contest you'd need to either change them enough that it wasn't really the same, or get permission from &gt;G and the original submitter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's be easiest just to take an idea from it and make something different enough to be yours.</p>",
